  "id": "chorizo-and-halloumi-breakfast-baguette",
  "name": "Chorizo and Halloumi Breakfast Baguette",
  "subtitle": "A warm, spicy breakfast sandwich with tomato jam and lime avocado.",
  "description": "Layer crisp-edged chorizo and halloumi in a baguette with creamy avocado, tangy onion, coriander, and a quick tomato jam.",
